@brucezhang1993/dsh-computer-use-linux README · dsh-computer-use-linux：**Linux desktop computer use for [DeepSeek Harness](https://github.com/deepseek-ai/deepseek-harness)** —
the [`computer-use-linux`](https://github.com/agent-sh/computer-use-linux) MCP
server bridged into DSH as native tools, with its skill bundled.

@brucezhang1993/dsh-computer-use-linux README · Architecture：```
DSH agent
  │  tools: mcp__cul__doctor, mcp__cul__get_app_state, mcp__cul__click, … (18)
  ▼
@deepseek-ai/dsh-mcp-client        ← in-box DSH bridge (official MCP SDK, stdio)

Two decisions define this integration:

@brucezhang1993/dsh-computer-use-linux README · Install：Install the plugin as a DSH bundle — there is no manual patch or config edit.
The full guide, including GitHub Packages authentication and the pre-download
step, is [docs/installation.md](docs/installation.md).

@brucezhang1993/dsh-computer-use-linux README · DSH Desktop — from GitHub Packages：Open the plugin manager and install `@brucezhang1993/dsh-computer-use-linux`
from the registry (search by name). Desktop profiles are managed exclusively by
the app, so `dsh plugin --profile desktop add …` is refused by design.

@brucezhang1993/dsh-computer-use-linux README · cordis.patch.yml — the whole declarative surface：The launcher path is resolved through `createRequire` anchored at the *profile*
directory (`baseUrl`), never hard-coded, so the bundle works in any profile
under any `$DSH_HOME` and survives the pnpm store layout.

@brucezhang1993/dsh-computer-use-linux README · License：MIT. See [LICENSE](LICENSE) and [THIRD_PARTY.md](THIRD_PARTY.md) — the desktop
engine is [agent-sh/computer-use-linux](https://github.com/agent-sh/computer-use-linux)
(MIT), and the bundled skill is adapted from it.

@brucezhang1993/dsh-computer-use-linux README · dsh-computer-use-linux：Agent 可以观察本机桌面（AT-SPI 无障碍树、窗口列表、截图），并对其执行操作（聚焦/移动/缩放窗口、点击、拖拽、滚动、输入文本、按键、调用无障碍动作）—— Wayland 与 X11 都支持，与 Claude Code、Codex 通过上游插件拿到的是同一套工具。

不改动 DSH 本体，无运行时依赖。桥接方就是 DSH 内置的
`@deepseek-ai/dsh-mcp-client` 插件。

@brucezhang1993/dsh-computer-use-linux README · DSH Desktop —— 从 GitHub Packages 安装：打开插件管理器，从 registry 里按名字搜索并安装
`@brucezhang1993/dsh-computer-use-linux`。Desktop 的 profile 由应用独占管理，因此
`dsh plugin --profile desktop add …` 会被设计性地拒绝。

@brucezhang1993/dsh-computer-use-linux README · 工具：上游还有两个条件性工具默认关闭，需显式开启：`run_shell`
（`COMPUTER_USE_LINUX_ENABLE_SHELL=1`，刻意不加沙箱——DSH 已经有带沙箱的 shell 工具）与 `complete_interaction`
（`COMPUTER_USE_LINUX_NOTIFY_ON_COMPLETE=1`）。

@brucezhang1993/dsh-computer-use-linux README · 许可证：MIT。见 [LICENSE](LICENSE) 与 [THIRD_PARTY.md](THIRD_PARTY.md) —— 桌面引擎是
[agent-sh/computer-use-linux](https://github.com/agent-sh/computer-use-linux)
（MIT），内置 skill 改编自它。
